  "notes": "scan_film with AUTO-EXPOSURE ON using the MATRIX metering pattern (a NON-center_weighted pattern; scan_portra_autoexp only covers center_weighted). Exercises the 5x5 raised-cosine zone-weighted branch of utils.autoexposure.measure_autoexposure_ev: the image is split into a 5x5 grid, each zone mean weighted by 0.5*(1+cos(pi*dist)) of its normalised distance from centre, the weighted average / 0.184 -> -log2(exposure) EV, then the image is globally scaled by 2**ev before crop/rescale. For the 64px image small_preview is a no-op (long edge 64 <= 256). Spatial/grain off so it stays bit-stable. Tested by tests/test_autoexposure.cpp.",
